# ─── Lead form delivery ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The lead form posts a Discord embed to this webhook.
# Create one in Discord: Server Settings → Integrations → Webhooks → New Webhook
# → Copy Webhook URL. Then copy this file to `.env` and paste the URL below.
#
# NOTE: PUBLIC_ vars are exposed in the client bundle (the site is static, so the
# browser does the POST). For production, consider proxying through a serverless
# function and pointing this — or a new channel in src/lib/leads.ts — at it.
PUBLIC_DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL="https://discord.com/api/webhooks/XXXXXXXX/YYYYYYYY"
